{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1021", "sample_idx": 35, "model_name": "meta/llama-3.3-70b-instruct", "content": "PARAGRAPH 1\nTHE SENTENCE \"IF THE LAW IS BAD, YOU SHOULD NOT FOLLOW IT\" IS A STATEMENT THAT RAISES SEVERAL CONCERNS REGARDING THE ROLE OF INDIVIDUALS IN RELATION TO THE LEGAL SYSTEM. ON ONE HAND, IT CAN BE ARGUED THAT THIS SENTENCE ENCOURAGES CIVIL DISOBEDIENCE AND PROMOTES A SENSE OF MORAL RESPONSIBILITY AMONG CITIZENS. HOWEVER, ON THE OTHER HAND, IT ALSO IMPLIES THAT INDIVIDUALS HAVE THE AUTHORITY TO UNILATERALLY DETERMINE THE VALIDITY OF A LAW, WHICH CAN LEAD TO CHAOS AND ANARCHY IF NOT PROPERLY REGULATED.\n\nPARAGRAPH 2\nFURTHERMORE, THE SENTENCE \"IF THE LAW IS BAD, YOU SHOULD NOT FOLLOW IT\" OVERLOOKS THE IMPORTANCE OF THE RULE OF LAW AND THE PRINCIPLE OF LEGAL CERTAINTY. IN A FUNCTIONING DEMOCRACY, LAWS ARE CREATED TO PROTECT THE RIGHTS AND INTERESTS OF CITIZENS, AND THEY ARE ENFORCED BY INSTITUTIONS THAT ARE DESIGNED TO ENSURE THEIR FAIR AND IMPARTIAL APPLICATION. BY ENCOURAGING INDIVIDUALS TO DISREGARD LAWS THAT THEY PERCEIVE AS \"BAD\", THIS SENTENCE UNDERMINES THE AUTHORITY OF THESE INSTITUTIONS AND CREATES AN ENVIRONMENT IN WHICH THE RULE OF LAW IS NO LONGER RESPECTED. THIS CAN HAVE SERIOUS CONSEQUENCES FOR THE STABILITY AND COHESION OF SOCIETY AS A WHOLE.", "logprobs": [{"token": "PAR", "logprob": -1.5497195136049413e-06}, {"token": "AGR", "logprob": -4.565611743601039e-05}, {"token": "APH", "logprob": -4.768370445162873e-07}, {"token": " ", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "1", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "\n", "logprob": -9.894321920000948e-06}, {"token": "THE", "logprob": -0.00062851223628968}, {"token": " SENT", "logprob": -0.14402322471141815}, {"token": "ENCE", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " \"", "logprob": -0.0008061258122324944}, {"token": "IF", "logprob": -1.597391747054644e-05}, {"token": " THE", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " LAW", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": " IS", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " BAD", "logprob": -1.07